Paraguay", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-06/how-a-banking-scandal-is-taking-down-trump-s-ally-in-paraguay", "excerpt": "Officials at the Inter-American Development Bank’s investment arm suspected something was off almost as soon as they walked through the doors of Paraguay’s Ueno Bank SA.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T00:24:58.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "The Corner Store Brings Its New York Experience to the Las Vegas Strip", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-06/the-corner-store-brings-nyc-experience-to-vegas-strip-video", "excerpt": "Catch Hospitality Group is opening a Las Vegas location of The Corner Store at the Cosmopolitan. Co-Founder and Partner Eugene Remm says the 150-seat restaurant will preserve the intimacy and authentic SoHo experience of its 75-seat New York original, rather than offer a Vegas-specific or watered-do", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T23:49:39.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "Catch Hospitality Group 将在拉斯维加斯 Cosmopolitan 开设 The Corner Store 分店。联合创始人 Eugene Remm 表示，这家150座餐厅将保留纽约原店75座的私密感与真实 SoHo 体验，而非照搬维加斯风格。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Elanco Shares Jump After Q3 Beat and Outlook Raise", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-06/elanco-shares-jump-after-q3-beat-and-outlook-raise-video", "excerpt": "Elanco Animal Health shares rose nearly 8% after the company reported third-quarter earnings above expectations and raised its full-year outlook. Jeff Simmons, Elanco’s President and CEO, called it a high-quality quarter, citing 11% reported growth and broad strength across markets and product lines", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T23:30:58.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "礼蓝动保（Elanco Animal Health）股价上涨近8%，此前公司第三季度业绩超出预期并上调全年指引。CEO Jeff Simmons 称本季为高质量季度，报告口径增长11%，各市场普遍强劲。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Sweetgreen CEO Says Sales Rebound After Cyclospora-Related Traffic Drop", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-06/sweetgreen-ceo-on-earnings-sales-rebound-video", "excerpt": "Sweetgreen CEO and Co-Founder Jonathan Neman says that sales momentum has improved after a summer Cyclospora outbreak—unrelated to Sweetgreen’s stores but damaging to traffic across the sector. The company reported October comparable sales growth of about 5%, following a return to flat comps in Sept", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T23:26:21.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "Sweetgreen CEO Jonathan Neman 表示，夏季环孢子虫疫情虽与公司门店无关，但拖累了全行业客流，此后销售动能已改善。公司10月同店销售增长约5%。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "FIGS Beats Earnings as Demand Outstrips Supply, CEO Trina Spear Says", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-06/figs-ceo-trina-spears-on-earnings-beat-video", "excerpt": "FIGS reported third-quarter top- and bottom-line results above expectations, with revenue of $190.7 million versus an estimate of $182.8 million. The company logged a fourth consecutive quarter of at least 25% revenue growth; non-scrubwear revenue rose 35%, and international revenue also increased. ", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T23:21:26.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "FIGS 第三季度营收与利润均超预期，营收1.907亿美元，高于预期的1.828亿美元。公司连续第四个季度营收增长至少25%，非手术服业务增长35%，国际营收亦上升。CEO 为 Trina Spear。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Braskem Owners Pull Funding Offer as Debt Talks Hit Snag", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-06/braskem-shareholders-pull-funding-offer-as-debt-talks-hit-snags", "excerpt": "Talks between Brazil’s Braskem SA and its creditors regarding an out-of-court debt rework have soured, with shareholders taking a proposed capital injection key to a deal off the table if talks stand as they are, according to people familiar with the matter.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T19:38:53.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "AI-Generated Movie Heading Theaters", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-06/ai-generated-movie-heading-theaters-video", "excerpt": "Artificial intelligence is moving from experimental videos to the big screen. Fable Studio CEO Edward Saatchi says a team of just 30 people spent nine months creating Gods Don’t Give Gifts, an AI-generated animated feature that still relies on human directors, writers, voice actors and artists. He j", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T22:29:48.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "AI 正从实验性视频走向大银幕。Fable Studio CEO Edward Saatchi 称，仅30人团队耗时九个月制作出 AI 生成动画长片「Gods Don't Give Gifts」，但仍依赖人类导演、编剧与配音演员。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Providing Capital to Tech Companies: Masters In Business with Ann Berry", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-06/masters-in-business-with-ann-berry-video", "excerpt": "Barry speaks with Ann Berry, founder and managing partner of Threadneedle. They discuss her path from Goldman Sachs M&A and private equity to running a hospitality services company through the pandemic. They also discuss Ann's early-stage bets on AI and deepfake detection, and surveying the expandin", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T22:15:53.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "Threadneedle 创始人兼管理合伙人 Ann Berry 接受访谈，谈及从高盛并购与私募股权转而在疫情期间经营酒店服务公司的经历，以及对 AI 和深度伪造检测的早期投资。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Canadian Dollar Notches Worst Week Since September on Weak Jobs", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-06/canadian-dollar-set-for-worst-week-since-september-on-weak-jobs", "excerpt": "The Canadian dollar posted its biggest weekly loss since late September after weaker-than-expected domestic employment data reinforced concerns about the outlook for the country’s economy.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:48:22.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}], "overview": "科技领域，开源编辑器Zed与英伟达语义图谱框架持续升温，OpenAI联手Hacktron排查系统漏洞，并推出湿实验室科研基准；人工智能研究节奏加快，但得州数据中心扩张面临政治变量。财经方面，美国中期选举结果引发AI股大幅回调，纳斯达克100反弹1.4%，市场重新评估AI增长预期；Anthropic仍推进IPO，目标估值1.5万亿美元。时政焦点集中于巴拉圭总统因银行业危机遭弹劾并软禁，以色列选举与新西兰大选均无决定性结果，欧洲检察官就西班牙高铁事故展开欺诈调查，中美围绕制裁措施再度交锋。", "market": {"market_overview": "美股端技术面整体偏弱分化：SPY现价735.29低于SMA20(763.36)与SMA50(765.68)，RSI14仅35.1，MACD -6.0762对信号-2.6522绿柱延续；QQQ日内+1.4%但较52周高点-13.99%、RSI14 31.4，NVDA、META同样承压，仅AAPL、MSFT维持多头排列，属指数弱、权重分化的格局。加密方面，总市值2.58T USD（24h -2.59%），BTC主导率59.2%、ETH 10.6%，BTC现价75991处SMA20(79656)下方、RSI14 38.7，恐慌贪婪指数25处「极度恐慌」，SOL RS134.2偏弱，ETH则出现MACD金叉，整体弱势中局部企稳。中概为全场最强：JD 5日+13.58%、RSI14 69.4，BABA、PDD均现MACD金叉，但0700.HK仍空头排列、日内-2.46%。商品外汇方面，黄金4079.5为空头排列但MACD金叉，WTI原油5日-13.23%并现MACD死叉，美元指数102.28接近52周高、呈多头排列，USDCNY 6.66偏空。宏观上VIX 25.64、5日+32.03%显示避险情绪抬升，10Y收益率4.86%处SMA20(5.03)下方，风险偏好整体收敛。", "watchlist": [{"symbol": "JD", "display_name": "京东 (JD)", "stance": "偏上行", "rationale": "现价29.11，日内+4.98%、5日+13.58%，为全组最强短期动量；站上SMA20(26.46)与SMA50(26.87)，MACD柱为正(0.0562对-0.2592)，已现MACD金叉。但RSI14达69.4，逼近超买区，且距52周高点仍-15.13%，追高需关注动量过热。"}, {"symbol": "GOOGL", "display_name": "Alphabet", "stance": "偏下行", "rationale": "现价284.78较SMA20(317.44)、SMA50(332.93)、SMA200(339.51)全面下方，呈空头排列；SMA50下穿SMA200形成死叉。RSI14仅29.9处超卖，MACD为-16.5773、信号-12.7862，绿柱扩张，距52周高点-30.31%，技术结构最弱。"}, {"symbol": "IVIX", "display_name": "VIX 恐慌指数", "stance": "中性", "rationale": "现价25.64，日内-9.01%但5日+32.03%，波动双向放大；价格高于SMA20(18.83)与SMA50(16.92)，RSI14为63.2偏强未超买，MACD 1.8528高于信号1.0736，红柱持续。指数处高位震荡，尚未给出明确单边方向。"}, {"symbol": "BABA", "display_name": "阿里巴巴 (BABA)", "stance": "中性", "rationale": "现价109.45，日内+3.95%、5日+9.96%，站上SMA20(105.09)但仍在SMA50(108.43)附近、SMA200(124.98)下方；MACD -1.884对信号-2.4748形成金叉，RSI14为55.3中性。短期动能改善，长期仍受制于均线压力，方向待确认。"}, {"symbol": "ETH-USD", "display_name": "Ethereum", "stance": "中性", "rationale": "现价2246.42，位于SMA20(2332.55)与SMA50(2498.9)下方，但仍高于SMA200(2156.3)；RSI14为40.6偏弱未超卖，MACD -58.1462已高于信号-60.7521，出现MACD金叉，绿柱收敛。距52周高点-38.56%，属弱势企稳结构。"}], "risk_c